      "content": "hey so i have this crazy pain in my side/flank area again it's radiating down towards my groin and it hurts like hell. i've had kidney stones before so i'm thinking its probably that again but i also feel like my stomach is pulsing a bit? is that normal with stones or should i be worried?",
