      "content": "u think it's just anxiety?? it feels really weird though, like a rhythmic thumping in my belly. if it's just the stones, can i just take some extra ibuprofen or something to get through the night? i really dont want to go to the er if i dont have to, it's so expensive and the wait is insane",
